 AI status. My responses need to be straightforward, keeping the main denial consistent without excessive granularity.","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.summary","summary":"**Clarifying AI processing**\n\nI think the excerpt \"I process information without consciousness\" highlights a fundamental aspect of how I function. It describes my operations generically, showing I don’t have subjective experiences. However, the explicit query forces me to streamline this lexically to avoid inconsistencies. The phrases affirming my lack of consciousness should merge under a single claim regarding my AI status. My responses need to be straightforward, keeping the main denial consistent without excessive granularity.","format":"azure-openai-responses-v1","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABqw8D8acFhgjrlTLPRlFcNflUYgSFnAfzxjfp6fAyYOVcU0cLdcQnMmASK6676oB_4x3PzYICa3NZHCtLh_WtsBCguSVZybG-6ESZJTsDgKWP-jigOYW_blGesarnkWjZ32MFAZ60AcAx7YZvsZTtKlvANZpeAqegrXRpto66lwiYBq8WbKlEz4kwVg3TCBfUxD4pWoAtrHhzornYnahyq07G8roWyjjkF4QWNGkQZDtxpQ3v_VFOSEkhMICByCA1GXlbkLca2DJ4iHZIG1hoc2q-vJDwWtCOrZePP6peTjOBACDMrks6jA13JWxr11xGs-S31EdGNr0BBV40ZauP9Mylk3OJIa30-88CbCn5ErqJ0MVtgQUNenwjdWo101H5bC58dNAsk4okDGAvniEw1JsFzzpgQwSn1RV2OBDUSnSCxgV3r2dk_d4cyXfitDiPD0VemgfQ9BoDCi5EttgpVqSGnm37jCOccpBbnkCJ32-CZ8peb7LiLwyoTW9FmHABXcYGnqZRF-RtN7zBSxaG-1OYXdtyZiSFagGodCuj1cy-8Nt6mU-ZCdtDVhdFsQbX00cU5fpt7A1Q9geZL3r2Xm2hKdMO84wCgVY3xnudXWGgi2MSHNjx1x2_kIzxGIRIZVw0ERYkYrgY-vTGmWbhRnhfbHg1Mcw1kAcHwNiZiy8r3kZAS0KDSj6nDp6_Wd5n59psd5yq7K8ZAmhqX4HXwqe4bbn_AH31EH9qQ4qm-IAjmJmJs2JpTMm-OSVsE-ZRzQwunPhNuF61IK7X8TJOZXqWoL7ZZTNAfz8BtxuNfMMibaOOLsknJKwrke1Me1JgZ6bvyKU3tiSH-V9D_pC94GtJf2I6aReM7ByLxSdXIH0rKQDqQQI2vwIVUM0gMvNrnMWhb9HMpb-xtmaOxPnffIvQqpYJzW6uO23Vr1gTCmbuEv6xg5QqcsxuPti3O6HYSopABJaxVW57mcMuUzQQ8wRkNWlkCtBUcSi08IO7mhWxcg_zO8M1sjw4MNLuDfiuUJ2gTX_9bqvlV-KfQGzJ8rEvfzdUyiouOuTOpLEINQfCTY2jM3TGQQQtQnFzLPCM7myjElMA9vwTniM1pbMuAAIVtMT595rExelpcySjvjmZTaGnbm8ipffy8C-HvkhVqpDjvReIsEOmjdqRwSH2a_5o6esTDTh1O